                                "sense_id": "e654a747-f204-3d52-92ea-c16e241bf5a1",
                                "text": "[E]arth has seen\n Love's brightest roses on the scaffold bloom,\n Mingling with freedom's fadeless laurels there,\n And presaging the truth of visioned bliss."
